      "name": "InitializeGameStructures",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameStructures(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes 10 core game engine structures with parameters from global data tables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set up exception handling frame with EH handler at 0x1023525a\n2. Load DAT_103e0a48 into ECX and call FUN_101718e0 for initialization\n3. For each of 10 structures (indices 0-9):\n   a. Copy source data from global data table into local stack buffer\n   b. Call FUN_101719f0 to parse/transform buffer data\n   c. Call FUN_10171dc0 to allocate structure instance\n   d. Call FUN_10172570 to register structure with index and source data\n4. Load structure 0 data again and call FUN_101719f0 to prepare final structure\n5. Call FUN_10171b40(&DAT_103e0a48) for post-initialization\n6. Call FUN_102336f9() to finalize engine structures (passes 0x10, 0xa, 0x101718f0 parameters)\n7. Destroy all 10 structure instances via thunk_FUN_101720d0 destructor calls\n8. Call FUN_10233b13(0x10245850) for cleanup\n9. Restore exception handler and return\n\nParameters:\nNone - void function, no parameters\n\nReturns:\nvoid - no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Exception state flag (exceptionState) incremented through 0x1-0x12 to track\n  initialization progress and enable proper exception recovery on failure\n- Each structure indexed with specific value (0,1,4,2,3,6,5,0x8b,0x8c,0x8f)\n- Magic parameters to FUN_102336f9: 0x101718f0 (likely function pointer), 0xa, 0x10\n- Global data tables accessed: DAT_10299b70, DAT_10299f50, DAT_10299cd0, DAT_10299c50,\n  DAT_10299c10, DAT_10299b60, DAT_10299fa0, DAT_10299d90, DAT_10299b20, DAT_10299f40,\n  DAT_10299bb0, DAT_1029a0a0\n- Structures use 12-byte (3x dword) local instances for initialization\n\nStructure Layout - 12-byte Structure Instance:\nOffset  Size  Field Name           Type       Description\n------  ----  -------------------- ---------- ----------------\n0x0     4     field0               dword      First structure element\n0x4     4     field1               dword      Second structure element\n0x8     4     field2               dword      Third structure element",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:39c5549cd11d810829907a99ee0cae28",
