      "name": "InitializeCharacterMappingTable",
      "signature": "void InitializeCharacterMappingTable(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes the character-to-index mapping table used for rapid character lookup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x248 bytes of local buffer space on stack\n2. Initialize a base context object at address 0x103e09ec\n3. Create 32 character-to-index mapping pairs:\n   - Character codes: 0x33 ('3'), 0x01, 0x30 ('0'), 0x04, 0x50 ('P'), 0x10, 0x41 ('A'), 0x20, \n     0x54 ('T'), 0x40, 0x47 ('G'), 0x80, 0x48 ('H'), 0x100, 0x32 ('2'), 0x200, 0x58 ('X'), 0x800,\n     0x52 ('R'), 0x2000, 0x37 ('7'), 0x4000, 0x57 ('W'), 0x8000, 0x36 ('6'), 0x02, 0x4E ('N'), 0x04,\n     0x4F ('O'), 0x10, 0x55 ('U'), 0x20, 0x49 ('I'), 0x40, 0x31 ('1'), 0x100, 0x38 ('8'), 0x200,\n     0x56 ('V'), 0x800, 0x42 ('B'), 0x1000, 0x59 ('Y'), 0x2000, 0x4D ('M'), 0x4000, 0x4A ('J'), 0x8000,\n     0x34 ('4'), 0x01, 0x35 ('5'), 0x02, 0x51 ('Q'), 0x04, 0x44 ('D'), 0x08, 0x4C ('L'), 0x20,\n     0x4B ('K'), 0x40, 0x5A ('Z'), 0x80, 0x45 ('E'), 0x200, 0x53 ('S'), 0x400, 0x39 ('9'), 0x800,\n     0x43 ('C'), 0x2000, 0x46 ('F'), 0x4000\n4. Call processor function at 0x101725d0 repeatedly to configure each mapping\n5. Call post-processor at 0x101719f0 to finalize table\n6. Store mapping configuration and invoke handler at 0x10171a10\n7. Execute final initialization at 0x10233b13\n\nReturns: void (no return value)",
