      "name": "InitializeLocationEntries",
      "signature": "void InitializeLocationEntries(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes location entries for Diablo II DLLs and sets up exception handling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current exception list and install custom exception handler\n2. Clear game data structures at 0x103e684c\n3. Create and setup location entries for 6 DLLs in sequence:\n   - ProjectDiablo2.dll (index 0)\n   - D2Hackmap.dll (index 1)\n   - D2ME.dll (index 2)\n   - D2CMP.dll (index 3)\n   - D2Maphack.dll (index 4)\n   - D2Client.dll (index 5)\n4. Initialize location info buffer from first location entry\n5. Update game data structures at 0x103e684c\n6. Perform initialization routine at address 0x102336f9\n7. Initialize global data at address 0x1024bf60\n8. Restore previous exception list and return\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Uses SEH (Structured Exception Handling) for Windows error handling\n- Each location entry corresponds to a specific Diablo II DLL module\n- Exception status variable tracks which initialization stage failed\n- Indices 0-5 track which DLL location was being initialized when exception occurred",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:82d047f68b57391f7575c242b3582598",
